### Track 1: AI Integration (Gemini LLM & RAG)

#### [MODIFY] [backend/routes/novia.js](file:///c:/Users/sande/Academics/web%20page/EchoReads/backend/routes/novia.js)
* **Goal**: Replace simple keyword checking with Google's `@google/generative-ai` SDK.
